hadiths[27]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1210","Hazrat Abu Rashid Hibrani rehmatullahi alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya main Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr raziyallahu anhuma ke paas aaya to maine kaha mujhe koi aisi hadees bayan kijiye jo aap ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se suni ho to unhon ne mujhe ek saheefa diya aur farmaya ye wo saheefa hai jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mere liye likhwaya tha phir maine us me dekha to us me ye tha ke Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq raziyallahu anhu ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sawal kiya aur arz kiya Ya Rasoolallah mujhe aisi dua sikha dijiye jo main subah aur shaam manga karun to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Ae Abu Bakr kaho Ae Allah aasmanon aur zameen ko paida karne wale ghaib aur hazir ko janne wale har cheez ke Rab aur Malik main Teri panah chahta hun apne nafs ke shar se aur shaitan ke shar aur us ke shirk se aur is se ke main apni jaan par koi bura amal karun ya use kisi musalman ki taraf kheench laun."
"1211","Hazrat Huzaifa raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab sone ka irada farmate to farmate Ae Allah Tere naam ke sath main marta hun aur jeeta hun aur jab apni neend se bedar hote to farmate Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne hamen is ke baad zinda kiya ke hamen maut de di thi aur usi ki taraf dobara uthna hai."
"1212","Hazrat Anas raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab apne bister par tashreef late to farmate Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne hamen khilaya aur pilaya aur hamen kafi ho gaya aur hamen thikana diya pas kitne hi log hain jin ke liye na koi kafalat karne wala hai aur na koi panah dene wala hai."
"1213","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam us waqt tak na sote jab tak Surah Sajdah aur Surah Mulk na parh lete Abu Zubair ne kaha ke ye dono surten Allah ki kitab ki har surat par sattar nekiyon se fazeelat rakhti hain pas jo inhen parhe ga us ke liye sattar nekiyan likhi jayengi aur us ke sattar darje buland kiye jayenge aur us se sattar gunah mita diye jayenge."
"1214","Hazrat Abdullah raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya zikr ke waqt neend ka aana shaitan ki taraf se hai agar tum chaho to aazma kar dekh lo jab tum me se koi apne bister par aaye aur sone ka irada kare to use chahiye ke Allah azza wa jal ka zikr kare."
"1215","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam us waqt tak na sote jab tak Tabarakallazi biyadihil Mulk aur Alif Lam Meem Tanzeel Al Sajdah na parh lete."
"1216","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jab tum me se koi apne bister par letne lage to apne izar ke kinare ko pakad kar us se apna bister jhaad le kyunke wo nahin janta ke us ke peeche us par kya cheez aa gayi hai aur use chahiye ke apni dayan karwat par lete aur kahe Tere naam se maine apna pehlu rakh diya Ae Allah agar Tu meri jaan ko qabz kar le to us par rehem farma aur agar Tu use chhor de to us ki hifazat farma us cheez ke sath jis ke sath Tu apne nek bandon ki hifazat farmata hai ya farmaya jis ke sath Tu apne bandon me se nek bandon ki hifazat farmata hai."
"1217","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya main apni khala Maimuna ke paas raat me thehra to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz parhne ke liye khare hue to main Aap ke bayen taraf khara ho gaya to Aap ne mera sar pakad kar mujhe apni dayan taraf kar diya."
"1218","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab apne bister par aate to farmate Ae Allah aasmanon ke Rab aur zameen ke Rab aur har cheez ke Rab dane aur guthli ko pharne wale Tauret aur Injeel aur Quran ko nazil karne wale main Teri panah mangta hun har shar wale ke shar se Tu us ki peshani pakde hue hai Tu hi Awwal hai pas Tere se pehle koi cheez nahin aur Tu hi Aakhir hai pas Tere baad koi cheez nahin aur Tu hi Zahir hai pas Tere upar koi cheez nahin aur Tu hi Batin hai pas Tere siwa koi cheez nahin meri taraf se qarz ada kar de aur mujhe faqr se ghani kar de."
"1219","Hazrat Bara bin Azib raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab apne bister par aate to apni dayan karwat par lette phir farmate Ae Allah maine apni jaan Tere supurd kar di aur apna chehra Teri taraf mutawajjeh kar diya aur apna muamla Tere hawale kar diya aur apni peeth Tere sahare laga di Teri taraf raghbat karte hue aur Tujh se darte hue Tere muqable me na koi panah hai aur na koi nijaat magar Teri taraf hi main iman laya Teri us kitab par jo Tu ne nazil farmai aur Tere us Nabi par jise Tu ne bheja phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jo shakhs ye kalimaat kahe phir usi raat me mar jaye wo fitrat par mara."
"1220","Hazrat Jabir raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya jab aadmi apne ghar me dakhil hota hai ya apne bister par aata hai to us ki taraf ek farishta aur ek shaitan bheje jate hain to farishta kehta hai bhalai par khatm kar aur shaitan kehta hai burai par khatm kar phir agar wo Allah ki hamd kare aur us ka zikr kare to farishta shaitan ko hata deta hai aur saari raat us ki hifazat karta hai phir jab wo bedar hota hai to us ki taraf farishta aur shaitan bheje jate hain aur dono isi tarah kehte hain phir agar wo Allah ka zikr kare aur kahe Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne meri rooh ko us ki maut ke baad mujh par lauta diya aur use us ki neend me maut nahin di Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jo aasmanon aur zameen ko thame hue hai ke wo hat na jayen aur agar wo hat jayen to us ke baad unhen koi thamne wala nahin beshak wo burdbar bakhshne wala hai Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jo aasman ko thame hue hai ke wo zameen par na gire magar us ke izn se beshak wo bandon par nihayat meherban rehem farmane wala hai to agar wo mar jaye to shaheed mare aur agar wo khara ho kar namaz parhe to bahut fazeelat wali namaz parhe."
"1221","Hazrat Bara raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab sone ka irada farmate to apna hath apne dayen rukhsar ke neeche rakhte aur farmate Ae Allah mujhe apne azab se bacha jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthayega aur Bara se doosre tareeq se bhi isi tarah riwayat kiya gaya hai."
"1222","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman nahin jo Chasht ki do rakaton par hamishgi karta ho magar Allah un dono ko mehboob rakhta hai, Sahaba ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool woh dono kaun si hain, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek har namaz ke peeche das tasbihen aur das hamden aur das takbiren kahe to ye zaban par ek sau pachaas hain aur tarazu mein ek hazar paanch sau hain, kaha: Phir Aap sallallahu alaihi wasallam unhen apne hath se ginne lage, farmaya: Phir woh letta hai to taitees martaba tasbih karta hai aur taitees martaba hamd karta hai aur chauntees martaba takbir kehta hai to ye zaban par ek sau hain aur tarazu mein ek hazar hain, phir tum mein se kaun din aur do raaton mein paanch sau buraiyan kamata hai, Sahaba ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasool koi is par amal kyun na karega, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak shaitan tum mein se kisi ke paas us ki namaz mein aata hai phir use duniya ki hajaten yaad dilata hai to woh tasbih yaad nahin karta."
"1223","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar par aaye to apne izar ke kinare ko pakde phir us se apne bistar ko jhaade aur Allah ka naam le kyunke woh nahin janta ke us ke baad us ke bistar par kya cheez us ki jagah rahi, phir apni dahini karwat par let jaye phir kahe: Ae Allah Tu paak hai aur Teri hamd ke sath main ne apni jaan ko panah di aur main ne apna pehlu uthaya aur mujhe mere letne ki jagah mein wafat de, Ae Allah agar Tu meri jaan qabz kare to use bakhsh de aur agar Tu use baqi rakhe to us ki us cheez se hifazat farma jis se Tu apne nek bandon ki hifazat farmata hai."
"1224","Hazrat Rabia bin Kaab raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke darwaze par raat guzarta tha main Aap ko jab Aap tahajjud padhte sunta kehte hue: Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne Us ki hamd ki, aur main Aap ko jab Aap apni namaz se lotte sunta kehte hue: Sab tareef Allah ke liye hai jo tamam jahanon ka Rab hai."
"1225","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo soya aur us ke hath mein gosht ki chiknahat thi aur us ne use dhoya nahin phir use koi cheez pahunchi to woh apne nafs ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"1226","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo soya aur us ke hath mein chiknahat thi phir use koi cheez pahunchi to woh apne nafs ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare."
"1227","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Raat ko darwaze band karo aur mashkizon ke munh bandho aur bartanon ko aundha karo ya unhen dhaanpo aur chiraaghon ko bujha do kyunke beshak shaitan na band darwaza kholta hai aur na bandhan kholta hai aur na dhaanp kholta hai aur beshak nuqsan dene wali chuhiya hi hai jo logon ka ghar jala deti hai."
"1228","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya: Ek chuhiya aayi aur batti kheenchne lagi to khadima use hatane ke liye gayi to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Use chhod do, phir woh batti le aayi aur use us chatai par daal diya jis par Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam the to us mein se ek dirham ke barabar jagah jal gayi to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum so jao to apne chiraagh bujha do kyunke beshak shaitan is jaise ko tumhari halakat par rehnumayi karta hai phir woh tumhen jala deta hai."
"1229","Hazrat Abu Saeed raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko jaagte rahe phir Aap ne ek chuhiya dekhi jo batti uthaye chhat par chadh rahi thi taake un par ghar ko aag laga de to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us par lanat ki aur Haram mein us ke qatl ko halal qarar diya."
"1230","Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum sote ho to apne gharon mein aag na chhodo."
"1231","Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Beshak aag dushman hai to us se bacho, phir Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma apne ghar mein aag ki khabar lete the aur sone se pehle use bujha dete the."
"1232","Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Apne gharon mein aag ko raat ko jalti hui na chhodo kyunke beshak woh tumhari dushman hai."
"1233","Hazrat Abu Musa raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: Madina Tayyaba mein ek ghar raat ko apne ghar walon samet jal gaya to is ka zikr Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kiya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ye aag tumhari dushman hai to jab tum so jao to use bujha do."
"1234","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya jab barish nazil hoti to woh kehte aye londi meri zeen aur mere kapde bahar nikaal aur ye tilawat karte aur Hum ne aasman se babarkat pani nazil kiya."
"1235","Hazrat Ibn Abbas raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hukm diya ke ghar me gandagi ko latkaya jaye."
"1236","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jab raat ho jaye to sakin raho aur na phiro kyunke tum me se koi nahi janta ke Allah apni makhlooq me se kya chalata hai aur darwaze band kar do aur mashkizon ke munh bandh do aur bartanon ko dhaanp do aur chiragh bujha do."
